  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rollout of Technology Managed Agricultural Mechanization Service Hubs for Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an agri-tech based grant that will equip the grantee with four tractors, enable them a software to manage the tractors from Hello Tractor and set up Potatoes Hub where a demo will be put for farmers to learn.</narrative>
